{"time_ns": 1794064536578146000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 12, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "904382cb0d76db234f3d0522b47e05b6a53ddab10942f56d44483d801e2f1582", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Executive Summary\nThis report summarizes the financial records across three regional territories, analyzing 24 transaction records (R001-R024) totaling **$10,289.28** (1,028,928 cents).\n\n## Regional Breakdown\n\n| Region | Total Amount | Record Count |\n|--------|-------------|--------------|\n| North  | $3,224.50   | 8 records    |\n| South  | $3,467.30   | 8 records    |\n| West   | $3,597.48   | 8 records    |\n| **TOTAL** | **$10,289.28** | **24 records** |\n\n## Analysis\nThe transactions are evenly distributed across three regions with 8 records each. The West region shows the highest total at $3,597.48, followed by South at $3,467.30, and North at $3,224.50. Transaction sizes vary considerably, ranging from $9.22 (R021) to $948.26 (R019).\n\n## Status\nJob completed successfully with all 24 records accounted for and regional totals calculated.\n", "ok": true}
